# Staff surfaces. Two rules matter here:
#
#   - `X-Robots-Tag: noindex` on everything. These pages must never appear in a
#     search result; the finance dashboard especially.
#   - `connect-src` is an allowlist, and the mirror image of ALLOWED_ORIGINS in
#     the API Worker. Add a call to a new host and it fails here first, which is
#     the intended order.
#
# Tighten `https://*.supabase.co` to the actual project ref once it exists.
#
# X-Frame-Options and frame-ancestors are both set: a staff dashboard has no
# reason to be embeddable, and clickjacking a "mark this cycle paid" button is a
# real outcome rather than a theoretical one.
#
# No 'unsafe-inline' anywhere. Every page loads an external module script, so
# there is no inline JS to allow — keep it that way.
#
# There is no _redirects file. Pages serves 404.html for unmatched paths with a
# real 404, which is what a staff surface should do; a `/* /index.html` rewrite
# would answer 200 to every probe. A 404 status is not even legal in _redirects.

/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; img-src 'self' https://images.groundsnearme.pk data:; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://unpkg.com; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com; script-src 'self' https://unpkg.com; connect-src 'self' https://api.groundsnearme.pk https://*.supabase.co http://127.0.0.1:8787

/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
